// Canonical source: delegation lends methods and subtype, not fields. D's own
// field d reads in D's code, on an E too, but it is not a field of E: an
// outside e.d is refused as field/not-found, voiced.
// Answer: "BML-HATI-UNSUPPORTED field/not-found"
class D : Object { section [public] { int d; int GetD() { return this.d; } } }
class E : Object, D { section [public] { } }
E e = new E();
return e.GetD() + e.d;
